ny","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_04_s_75","text":"You know the capacitors that measure the power coming into the substation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_04_s_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_04_s_76","text":"I think they may be broken. They haven't been giving out any readings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_04_s_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_04_s_77","text":"Huh? That's strange.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_04_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_04_s_78","text":"Wasn't everything working fine yesterday?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_04_s_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_04_s_79","text":"I'll check if there's an issue with the power source tomorrow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_04_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_04_s_80","text":"You know where the power source is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_04_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_04_s_81","text":"It's just a matter of tracing the power back to its source. Nothing too difficult.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":n